      "cooked": "<p>I am trying to remove delivery date for item table in Sales Order to be not mandatory, but even if I uncheck the Mandatory button in child item table, I am not able to save the Sales Order as its asking for each item delivery date.<br>\nBelow are screenshots,</p>\n<p>Made delivery date in child table item-sales order as not mandatory<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/4/e43a534c3e2973674bc4cfc3599ae8ff85841a43.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e43a534c3e2973674bc4cfc3599ae8ff85841a43\" title=\"2\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e43a534c3e2973674bc4cfc3599ae8ff85841a43_2_690x374.png\" alt=\"2\" data-base62-sha1=\"wyZP8B343PtneFY91MDMtRSjwXh\" width=\"690\" height=\"374\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e43a534c3e2973674bc4cfc3599ae8ff85841a43_2_690x374.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e43a534c3e2973674bc4cfc3599ae8ff85841a43_2_1035x561.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/4/e43a534c3e2973674bc4cfc3599ae8ff85841a43_2_1380x748.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F8F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">2</span><span class=\"informations\">2306×1251 162 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Yet it is not letting me save the sales order, as it is asking me for delivery date of each item<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/3/33b7fe510516ce58322c4e91229bda2cafb87699.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/33b7fe510516ce58322c4e91229bda2cafb87699\" title=\"1\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/3/33b7fe510516ce58322c4e91229bda2cafb87699_2_436x500.png\" alt=\"1\" data-base62-sha1=\"7nwypKmrsZ6kcWomfPVYG2ql1i1\" width=\"436\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/3/33b7fe510516ce58322c4e91229bda2cafb87699_2_436x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/3/33b7fe510516ce58322c4e91229bda2cafb87699_2_654x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/3/3/33b7fe510516ce58322c4e91229bda2cafb87699_2_872x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"E9E9E9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">1</span><span class=\"informations\">1155×1324 69.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Even the main Delivery date field of the form is set to not mandatory.<br>\nAny way to resolve this?</p>",
