      "id": 478181,
      "username": "Bala726",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-08-19T16:41:09.093Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The Delivery Date in the  Sales Order Item is not set as a mandatory field at the child document level. Instead, it is enforced programmatically. This means that even if you check or uncheck the “Mandatory” option, the system will still require a Delivery Date.</p>\n<p>If you try to remove the mandatory setting for Delivery Date, and a Sales Order Item does not have a Delivery Date, it may cause issues.</p>",
